.TH DATABASE-BACKUP 1 "2026-02-21" "ShellScript Toolkit" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
database-backup \- automated database backups with rotation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B database-backup
[\fIdb-url\fR] [\fIretention-days\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates timestamped backups of MySQL or PostgreSQL databases
with automatic rotation of old backups.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
MySQL: mysqldump
.PP
PostgreSQL: pg_dump
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B database-backup mysql://user:pass@localhost/prod_db 7
Backs up prod_db, keeps 7 days of backups
.TP
.B BACKUP_DIR=/backups database-backup postgres://host/mydb 30
Custom backup location, 30 day retention
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B BACKUP_DIR
Backup directory (default: ./backups)
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Fabbio for ShellScript Toolkit Pro
